# Non-secret production build flags. Never put keys or tokens here.
# Lets the app attach consented signup attribution after sign-up.
VITE_ACQUISITION_MEASUREMENT_ENABLED=true
# Same GA4 stream id as the marketing site; the app follows the dosya.dev
# banner's analytics choice (src/lib/analytics.ts). Empty = inert.
VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-FF7Y4WZ3F0
# Hides the email + password sign-up form; the API refuses it anyway
# (EMAIL_SIGNUP_DISABLED in apps/api/wrangler.jsonc). Closed 2026-11-22.
VITE_EMAIL_SIGNUP_DISABLED=true
